Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.18,注释,,0,0,0,,翻译  1440kHz
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.36,0:00:02.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.36,0:00:02.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿从石中拔出了锅铲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pulled the spatula from the stone
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.15,0:00:06.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,区区一介少年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:06.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As just a lad
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.95,0:00:09.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天赋异禀在身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:09.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A special gift he had
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.22,0:00:14.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对抗邪恶  英勇挥舞武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:14.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wielding gallantly while fighting evil
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,发型多飘逸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With a cool hairdo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,腹肌也紧实
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And nice abs, too
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有一夜他看见了异象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He had a vision one night
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他咬了一口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And took a bite
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.75,0:00:26.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感到美味可口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:26.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Feeling its delight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉醒了天命
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Realized his destiny
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还知道自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And knew that he
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须与你料理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must cook with thee
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.25,0:00:40.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用一张秘方制作出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:40.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A secret recipe was used to prepare
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.03,0:00:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一百万份蟹黄堡  意在来分享
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,1 million Krabby Patties that he wanted to share
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.05,0:00:47.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分给全海洋里的每一条鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:47.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With every single fish in the entire sea
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.78,0:00:54.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是一个传说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:54.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quite a legend was he
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.57,0:00:57.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两份蟹黄堡  不加腌椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:57.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two Krabby Patties, no pickles
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,诚然如此  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:00.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yea, verily, Squidward
